From: Maks Orlovich <morlovich@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:05:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [Backport] CVE-2026-76029: Memory corruption in Network

Cherry-pick of patch originally reviewed on
https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8608994:
HttpCache::Transaction reject overlong range responses

...that is, those that don't match the length of their own
Content-Range.

Bug: 572055997
Change-Id: I7a0ca8652462fa890cf04944c21e0674d3d21815
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8608994
